  "releaseNotes": "Breaking release: the build preset is now `aot` (was `aot-plus-trimming`), the target key is now `archiveFormats` (was `archive`), and an absent archive key defaults to zip plus tar.gz on Unix-based rids. New: `--dry-run`, `--verbose`, tar.xz archives, and a detection-seeded, `--interactive` init. See CHANGELOG.md.",
